{"version":1,"key":"card:441","content":{"id":441,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"格式字符串时可以使用指令设置格式"}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_d5abde1d-9106-41d6-9b90-49ab323be9fc.png","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"code-block","code":">>> print(\"{pi!s} {pi!r} {pi!a}\".format(pi=\"π\"))\nπ 'π' '\\u03c0'","language":"py","uuid":"d307c158-5b8b-47a3-9d3f-bf057b67e8e1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"上述三个标志（"},{"type":"formatted","text":"s","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"、"},{"type":"formatted","text":"r","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"a","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"）指定分别使用 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"str","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"、"},{"type":"formatted","text":"repr","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"ascii","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 进行转换。函数 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"str","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 通常创建外观普通的字符串版本（这里没有对输入字符串做任何处理）。函数 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"repr","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 尝试创建给定值的 Python 表示（这里是一个字符串字面量）。函数 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"ascii","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 创建只包含 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"ASCII","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 字符的表示，类似于 Python 2 中的 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"repr","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"。"}]},{"type":"divide-line","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"还可指定要转换的值是哪种类型，提供一个整数，但将其作为小数进行处理"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":">>> \"The number is {num}\".format(num=42)\n'The number is 42'\n>>> \"The number is {num:f}\".format(num=42)\n'The number is 42.000000'","language":"py","uuid":"023cea38-45c1-4ba2-ac8f-617697446715","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"设置浮点数（或其他更具体的小数类型）的格式时，默认在小数点后面显示 6 位小数。"}]},{"type":"divide-line","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"可根据需要在格式说明中指定宽度和精度"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":">>> \"{num:10}\".format(num=3)\n'          3'\n>>> \"{name:10}\".format(name=\"Bob\")\n'Bob        '","language":"py","uuid":"264a4662-52fd-43d5-84fe-ba70ffbd86e8","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"text":"精度也是使用整数指定的，但需要在它前面加上一个表示小数点的句点","type":"formatted"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":">>> \"Pi day is {pi:.2f}\".format(pi=pi)\n'Pi day is 3.14'","language":"py","uuid":"705f03b8-ccd8-4473-99b7-691dea05e586","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"同时指定宽度和精度"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":">>> \"{pi:10.2f}\".format(pi=pi)\n'       3.14'","language":"py","uuid":"800b81d9-5faa-4b03-80bb-6f49886b7b5a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"divide-line","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在指定宽度和精度的数前面，可添加一个标志。这个标志可以是零、加号、减号或空格，其中零表示使用 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"0","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 来填充数字。"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":">>> '{:010.2f}'.format(pi)\n'0000003.14'\n>>> '{:+10.2f}'.format(pi)\n'     +3.14'\n>>> '{:-10.2f}'.format(pi)\n'      3.14'","language":"py","uuid":"74584b70-ce97-41ab-b0a1-b7c7cc43d492","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"divide-line","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"左对齐、右对齐和居中，可分别使用 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"<","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"、"},{"type":"formatted","text":">","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"^","code":true}]},{"type":"code-block","code":">>> print('{0:<10.2f}\\n{0:^10.2f}\\n{0:>10.2f}'.format(pi))\n3.14\n  3.14\n    3.14","language":"py","uuid":"b1f2d2d6-9c48-40e2-86ce-9b1c815b5893","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"可以使用填充字符来扩充对齐说明符，这样将使用指定的字符而不是默认的空格来填充。"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":">>> \"{:$^15}\".format(\" WIN BIG \")\n'$$$ WIN BIG $$$'","language":"py","uuid":"a8e03518-a387-478a-b410-5715314b9ded","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}],"tags":["Python/字符串/格式字符串"],"createTime":1719045611664,"updateTime":1743303640440,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1743303640440}}